00:34:57.659 --> 00:35:00.659
And the fact that you're from a galaxy far, far away

00:35:00.659 --> 00:35:03.940
just adds character.

00:35:03.940 --> 00:35:07.900
And you know, I'm here.

00:35:07.900 --> 00:35:11.900
No matter what side of nature or nurture happens to be winning out.

00:35:11.900 --> 00:35:15.980
It goes both ways, Chloe.

00:35:15.980 --> 00:35:23.860
Whatever happened in that dam.

00:35:23.860 --> 00:35:24.860
You ended up in a morgue.

00:35:24.860 --> 00:35:26.860
Yeah, it was nothing.

00:35:26.860 --> 00:35:28.860
I'm just saying that when you're ready...

00:35:28.860 --> 00:35:37.800
Thanks.

00:35:37.800 --> 00:35:42.929
There you are.

00:35:42.929 --> 00:35:43.929
I forgive you.

00:35:43.929 --> 00:35:47.909
For what?

00:35:47.909 --> 00:35:48.909
Oh, don't make me relive it.

00:35:48.909 --> 00:35:50.909
It was traumatizing enough the first time around.

00:35:50.909 --> 00:35:53.909
And by the way, you've got some explaining to do there, Missy.

00:35:53.909 --> 00:35:57.190
Lois, I'm sorry.

00:35:57.190 --> 00:35:58.190
I know you are.

00:35:58.190 --> 00:36:00.190
And I know you didn't mean it.

00:36:00.190 --> 00:36:02.190
You were just in shock.

00:36:02.190 --> 00:36:14.780
Clerk, I'm so sorry.

00:36:14.780 --> 00:36:19.780
Look, all I can say is, at first you don't know how you'll ever make it through.

00:36:19.780 --> 00:36:21.780
But somehow you do.

00:36:21.780 --> 00:36:30.059
Just trust me on this one.

00:36:30.059 --> 00:36:35.059
But if you ever grab my ass again, I will be taking your head with me when I go.

00:36:35.059 --> 00:36:52.260
Your father would be proud.

00:36:52.260 --> 00:36:58.070
He did everything he could to prepare you.

00:36:58.070 --> 00:37:03.070
But bravery is not something you can learn.

00:37:03.070 --> 00:37:06.730
How much bravery does it take when you're getting pummelmed?

00:37:06.730 --> 00:37:07.730
How much bravery does it take when you're getting pumped?

00:37:07.730 --> 00:37:11.039
Hello.

00:37:11.039 --> 00:37:16.699
You could have ignored all the phantoms that escaped the phantom zone.

00:37:16.699 --> 00:37:21.019
But you chose to take responsibility and stop them.

00:37:21.019 --> 00:37:23.019
Even one more powerful than you.

00:37:23.019 --> 00:37:29.719
In a weird way, he may have been right.

00:37:29.719 --> 00:37:31.719
Maybe I have allowed myself to become weak,

00:37:31.719 --> 00:37:35.719
caring too much about everything, everyone here.

00:37:35.719 --> 00:37:37.719
You've learned a lot from your time in Smolville.

00:37:37.719 --> 00:37:42.610
These people have made you who you are.

00:37:42.610 --> 00:37:48.099
They won't always be here.

00:37:48.099 --> 00:37:52.099
Losing Lana has made me realize no matter how close I get

00:37:52.099 --> 00:37:57.039
someday they'll all be gone.

00:37:57.039 --> 00:37:59.039
All the time that I've spent ignoring my destiny,

00:37:59.039 --> 00:38:26.139
trying to be something I'll never be, human.

00:38:26.139 --> 00:38:31.789
Oh, save me.

00:38:31.789 --> 00:38:33.789
Nothing's real

00:38:33.789 --> 00:38:38.789
until you let go completely.

00:38:38.789 --> 00:38:46.099
So here I go with all my thoughts

00:38:46.099 --> 00:38:49.099
I've been saving.

00:38:49.099 --> 00:38:53.369
So here I go

00:38:53.369 --> 00:38:57.639
feels weighing

00:38:57.639 --> 00:38:59.639
on

